# Ventzon — agent rules

## Never modify without asking
- src/app/auth/callback/route.ts (Supabase session bridge)
- capacitor.config.ts
- package.json capacitor/apple-sign-in versions (SwiftPM pin, patched via postinstall)
- Any supabase/migrations/ file

## Always
- Run `npm run lint` before declaring a task done
- Match existing file style; do not reformat unrelated lines
- Mark merchant/monetization work with `// POST-BETA:`

## Current focus
User-facing polish for public beta: UI, animations, navigation,
onboarding, feed, profiles, comments, search, Explore, posting,
video playback, upload UX. Not infrastructure or hardening.
